stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> QUEUED
    QUEUED --> RUNNING: claim succeeds
    RETRYING --> RUNNING: claim succeeds
    RUNNING --> READY_FOR_REVIEW: results saved
    RUNNING --> FAILED: error without fallback
    RUNNING --> AWAITING_FALLBACK_CONFIRMATION: eligible free-model failure
    AWAITING_FALLBACK_CONFIRMATION --> RETRYING: paid approval within 5 minutes
    AWAITING_FALLBACK_CONFIRMATION --> CANCELLED: declined or worker processes expiry
    QUEUED --> CANCELLED: user cancels
    RETRYING --> CANCELLED: user cancels
    RUNNING --> CANCELLED: user cancels
    FAILED --> RETRYING: retry same job
    CANCELLED --> RETRYING: retry same job
    READY_FOR_REVIEW --> [*]
